==English==

==={{acronym}}===
'''TUPE'''

# Transfer of Undertakings (Protection of Employment)

===Verb===
{{en-verb}}

#{{British|colloquial}} To transfer (an employee or group of employees) to another employer under TUPE regulations.  

====Usage notes====
*Most commonly encountered in the passive voice, ''eg'' "Following the outsourcing agreement, the IT department was TUPE'd out to BigSys Corporation."

